---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { EMAIL, LINKS, SITE_NAME } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title={`About · ${SITE_NAME}`} description="What the projects are and how to get in touch." current="about">
  <section class="wrap about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="body">
      <p>I build tools for problems I keep running into, and write up how they work and how well they do.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>NIR AutoML</strong>: an automatic calibration pipeline for near-infrared spectra, from upload to a validated model with a PDF report.</li>
        <li><strong><a href="https://ivive.app">ivive.app</a></strong>: predicts human hepatic clearance from in-vitro data, with the error range real drugs showed. Also usable from an LLM through MCP.</li>
        <li><strong><a href="https://goblingains.com">Goblin Gains</a></strong>: one training log for strength and conditioning, from Hyrox to bodybuilding.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="contact">Get in touch</h2>
      <p>Questions about a project, data to run, or anything else: write to me.</p>
      <dl class="contact">
        <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>LinkedIn</dt><dd><a href={LINKS.linkedin}>{LINKS.linkedin.replace(/^https:\/\/(www\.)?/, '').replace(/\/$/, '')}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>GitHub</dt><dd><a href={LINKS.github}>{LINKS.github.replace(/^https:\/\//, '')}</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
